  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe ,Inclusive and Responsible Sport in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghten sport governance and practices to deliver safe, inclusive and responsible sport and physical activities for all. The project aims to promote social inclusion of persons with disabilities by expanding their access to and participation in sports. Persons with disabilities are among the project&apos;s target groups.  The project aims to expand opportunities for refugees to benefit from and participate in sports. Refugees are among the project&apos;s target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
